  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Librum Regularum a Sanctitate tua editum, et ad nos divina gratia opitulante perlatum , tanto liben­ tius legimus, quanto in eo spiritales regulas inesse cognoscimus.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quis non libentius legat, ubi jugi me­ ditatione medicinam animae suae inveniat,",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ubi con­ temptis hujus saeculi rebus caducis in sua mutabili­ late variantibus , ad æternæ vitæ stationem oculos mentis aperiat?",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Liber hic tuus omnium est aula vit­ tutum. illic prudentia inter bonum et malum discre­ tionem limitis figit: justitia unicuique sua tribuit, dum Deo animam , corpusque animae subdit.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Illic fortitudo etiam in adversis et in prosperis reperitur semper aequalis, quae nec in contrariis frangitur, nec in prosperis exaltatur.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Illic temperantia furorem li­ bidinis frangit, discreteque voluptatibus modum imponit. Illic cuncta quae ad vitae æternæ partici­ piutn pertinent comprehendis :",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et non solum pasto­ ribns regulam vivendi describis, sed etiam his qui re­ liminis officium nullum habent, vivendi regulam tri­ buis.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Habent enim pastores in quadripartita tua distri­ bulione quales ad hoc officium veniant; qualem vitam gerant cum venerint;",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.2.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.2.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qualiter vel qualia doceant; et ne in tanto sacerdotali culmine extollantur, quid agant.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.3.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.3.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Attestantur buic eximiae doctrinae sancti antiqui Patres doctores, defensoresque Ecclesiae, Hilarius, Ambrosius, Augustinus, Gregorius Nazianzenus :",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.3.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "hi omnes testimonium tibi praebent, sicut apostolis prae­ buerunt prophetae.Hilarius sanctus dicit, exponens ver- ba Apostoli doctoris gentium.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.3.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ita etenim quæ propriae disciplinae et morum sunt, ad sacerdoti i merilum uti­ lia esse significat.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.3.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "si etiam haec quæ ad docendæ ac te­ nendae Mei scienliam necessaria sunt, inter reliqua non deerunt :",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.3.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quia non statim boni atque utilis sa­ cerdotis est, aut tantummodo scienter [Ms. Tolet., innocenter] agere , aut tantummodo scienter praedi­ care;",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.3.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "cum et innocens tantum sui sufficiat si [Ms. To- Ut., sibi proficiat nisil doctus sit, et doctus nisi do­ ctrina vivendo.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Attestatur huic [Ms. Tolet., Si aoctrinam vivendo non adjuvet, omnino sibi nihil prosit.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Attestatur huic, etc.] libro tuo sanctus Ambrosius in illis libris quos fecit de Officiis.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Attestatur sanctus Augustinus dicens : < In actione non amandus est honor in hac vita sine [Ms. Tolet. sive in] potentia, quoniam omnia vana sub sole.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed opus ipsum, quod per eumdem honorem vel potentiam fit, si recte atque utiliter fit, id est, ut valeat ad eam salutem subdito­ rum quæ secundum Deum est.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "» Propter quod ait Apostolus : Qui episcopatum desiderat, opus bonum desiderat.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Exponere voluit quid sit episcopus, quia nomen est operis, non honoris : Graecum est enim , et inde ductum vocabulum, quod ille qui praeficitur,",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "eis quibus praeficitur superintendit, curam scilicet eorum gerens : episcopus [Ms. Tolet., episcopatus episcopi] quippe intentio est.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ergo episcopum, si ve­ limus Latine, superintendere [Ms. Tolet., superinten­ dentem] possum dicere.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ut intelligat non se esse episcopum, qui praeesse dixerit [Ms. Tolet., dilexerit], non prodesse.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ita enim ab studio cognoscendae veri­ tatis nemo prohibetur, quod ad laudabile perlinet otium :",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "locus vero superior, sine quo regi populus non potest, etsi ita teneatur atque administretur ut decet, tamen indecenler appetitur.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quamobrem otium sanctum quærit charilas : percipiendae ac tuendae vacandum est veritati [Ms. Tolet., veritatis negotium justum suscipit necessitas charitatis].",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Si autem imponitur, suscipienda est propter charitatis necessitatem.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.4.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.4.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed necsicomnimodoveritatis [Ms. To­ let., veritati] delectatio deserenda est, ne subtraha­ tur illa suavitas, et opprimatur ista necessitas",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an#PL72.AN.5.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/licinianus-carthaginensis/pl72_29_an",
    "canonical_ref": "PL72.AN.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Attestatur Gregorius sanctus, cujus stylum seque­ ris, cujus exemplo delitescere cupiebas, ut pondus sacerdotii declinares, quod quale sit in toto libro tuo liquide declaratur;",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 591,
    "date_range": [
      580,
      602
    ],
